      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo></math>",
